              <item row="2" column="1">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="label_32">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>In this section the necessary data for the execution of TopAGNPS will be entered. First, add the raster layers to be processed by TopAGNPS. Then there is the option to modify the Control Files and to add the outlet of the basin in the QGIS canvas. Once the execution of TopAGNPS is finished, the soil type and soil management will be added. To do this, the layers that contain it will be chosen. In case these data do not vary spatially, a single value of the soil type and a single value of the soil management can be chosen. Finally there is the option to choose whether to run TopAGNPS or not. </string>
                </property>
                <property name="alignment">
